{
  "about": "Every number the README and docs publish, with the run that produced it. tools/reproduce.py re-runs each claim with the same tool and settings into a new folder and compares the new numbers with the published ones. 'published' is the source run's own output file, never a hand-typed number; 'relations' are the sentences the README makes from it (faster: the 95% intervals do not overlap; tie: they overlap).",
